  "dcterms:title": "EPA TSCA Inventory (July 2025) \u2014 RDF transformation",
  "dcterms:description": "An RDF (N-Triples) transformation of the July 2025 U.S. EPA TSCA (Toxic Substances Control Act) Chemical Substance Inventory. CAS-identified substances and confidential PMN accession records are kept as distinct regulatory entries; parseable structures are linked to canonical InChIKey compound hubs (computed with RDKit) while unresolvable structures keep their EPA/CAS identity. Derived from the upstream 'epa-tsca-inventory' BioBrick, whose source is the EPA TSCA Inventory; some structures carry PubChem/CompTox provenance.",
